摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Three Departments and Six Ministries governance mode plugin for DeepSeek Harness | dsh 三省六部模式插件","id":"gh:1343340055","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tang-governance","slug":"Ruszero01/dsh-tang-governance","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Three Departments and Six Ministries governance mode plugin for DeepSeek Harness | dsh 三省六部模式插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"A scale-aware, runtime-enforced multi-agent governance mode for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"# Tang Governance"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Tang Governance is an independent npm bundle that adds a **Three Departments and Six Ministries** de"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"velopment mode to DeepSeek Harness. It does not patch Harness source code."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The plugin turns a single coding request into an auditable workflow with requirement clarification, "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"independent review, explicit user approval, responsibility-based execution, acceptance testing, and "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"a user-controlled closure gate. Runtime checks enforce the important boundaries instead of relying o"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"d closure gate. Runtime checks enforce the important boundaries instead of relying on prompts alone."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> Inspired by the Tang dynasty's administrative structure; designed for modern AI-agent software del"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ired by the Tang dynasty's administrative structure; designed for modern AI-agent software delivery."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Scale-aware intake** — Zhongshu classifies the request as small, medium, or large and keeps simp"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"le tasks out of unnecessary full-process loops.\n- **Clarification before drafting** — ambiguous requ"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"irements pause at a native choice interface before a solution is written.\n- **Independent review and"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" countersignature** — Menxia reviews the specification independently and may remand concrete issues."},{"id":"p9s5","text":"\n- **Explicit user gates** — implementation cannot begin before approval; a case cannot close before"},{"id":"p9s6","text":" final acceptance and user confirmation.\n- **Uniform ministry routing** — Shangshu scans all six res"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ponsibility domains using the same rules, dispatching only the ministries that materially contribute"},{"id":"p9s8","text":".\n- **Runtime-enforced boundaries** — delegation hierarchy, ministry roles, dependencies, verificati"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"on, approval, and closure are validated by code.\n- **Observable execution** — a responsive organizat"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"ion map, collapsible phase timeline, per-agent token usage, live status, and department records stay"},{"id":"p9s11","text":" visible in one dashboard.\n- **Stable model inheritance** — the Three Departments can be routed inde"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"pendently; the Six Ministries inherit Shangshu's provider and model while using task-appropriate rea"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"soning effort.\n- **Durable case files** — every task produces a structured dossier under .tang/cases"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"/<case-id>/.\n- **Workspace knowledge** — every new case receives a compact shared index, expands onl"},{"id":"p9s15","text":"y relevant details or source dossiers on demand, and lets Zhongshu deduplicate reusable findings int"},{"id":"p9s16","text":"o one canonical document.\n- **Recoverable stop semantics** — the user may stop work at any time with"},{"id":"p9s17","text":"out discarding completed artifacts."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Product tour"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Native mode entry"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Select the governance mode directly from the Harness preset menu."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Organization map + live trace"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Department state, routing controls, real calls, phases, and token usage share one responsive view."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Clarify before planning"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Zhongshu asks task-specific questions before drafting when the original request is ambiguous."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Reviewable approval gate"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The countersigned Markdown proposal is rendered in a dedicated approval workspace."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Auditable department records"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Department cards expose chronological stages, evidence, and final status without leaving the dashboa"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"artment cards expose chronological stages, evidence, and final status without leaving the dashboard."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"User-controlled closure"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Acceptance evidence, artifacts, risks, and the chronicle remain reviewable before the case is closed"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"cceptance evidence, artifacts, risks, and the chronicle remain reviewable before the case is closed."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Requirements:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Node.js ^22.19.0 || >=24\n- DeepSeek Harness 0.1.1-rc.2 or a compatible 0.1.x release"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Install from a local checkout:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Open http://127.0.0.1:3080 and select the mode for a new task."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"On first launch, the plugin copies the installed Harness **Standard mode** through the public Agent "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"Preset API and appends its governance tools. Shell, file operations, skills, goals, plans, subagents"},{"id":"p29s3","text":", and workflow primitives therefore follow the installed Harness version rather than a frozen source"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"workflow primitives therefore follow the installed Harness version rather than a frozen source copy."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Workflow"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Six Ministries"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Shangshu applies the same matching procedure to all six departments. No ministry is preferred, manda"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"tory, exempt, or used as a generic fallback."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Ministry | Domain | Owns | Does not own |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| Personnel / 吏部 | repository-governance | Repository reconnaissance, module ownership, task decompo"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"sition, dependencies, and handoff order | Product implementation or test approval |\n| Revenue / 户部 |"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" data-dependencies | Data and state models, migrations, dependency resources, performance impact, an"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"d related implementation | Unrelated product features or final acceptance |\n| Rites / 礼部 | interface"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"s-documentation | API/UI contracts, compatibility, accessibility, documentation, user experience, an"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"d related implementation | Unrelated infrastructure or final acceptance |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## 核心特性"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- **按量级受理**：中书省只判断任务量级，避免简单需求运行冗长流程。\n- **起草前澄清**：需求存在阻塞性歧义时，先通过原生选择界面询问用户，再继续起草。\n- **独立审议与会签**：门下省独立"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"审查规格，并可针对具体问题封驳。\n- **明确的用户门禁**：批准前不能进入执行，终验和用户确认前不能结案。\n- **六部统一扫描**：尚书省按相同规则扫描六个职责域，仅调度能产生实际贡献的部门。\n-"},{"id":"p37s3","text":" **运行时职责约束**：派发层级、部门角色、依赖、独立验证、审批与结案均由代码校验。\n- **可视化执行**：响应式架构图、可折叠阶段时间线、部门记录、实时状态和 Token 统计集中展示。\n- *"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"*稳定模型继承**：三省可分别路由模型，六部统一继承尚书省的 provider 和 model，再按任务调整思考等级。\n- **持久化案卷**：每个任务在 .tang/cases/<case-id>/"},{"id":"p37s5","text":" 下留下结构化文档。\n- **工作区知识案卷**：新案只预载共享索引，按需展开相关详情与原案证据，并由中书省将可复用结论去重写入唯一知识源。\n- **可恢复叫停**：用户可随时叫停任务，同时保留已经完"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"档。\n- **工作区知识案卷**：新案只预载共享索引，按需展开相关详情与原案证据，并由中书省将可复用结论去重写入唯一知识源。\n- **可恢复叫停**：用户可随时叫停任务，同时保留已经完成的产物与证据。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
